WEBVTT

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:31.440
Hold on to...

00:01:41.960 --> 00:01:42.520
Emotion

00:01:54.210 --> 00:01:56.700
Reynar, Thorfinn, you're friends from today.

00:02:02.910 --> 00:02:06.090
Come on, greet them. I'll give you the same job.

00:02:06.790 --> 00:02:07.830
I'll help you.

00:02:08.390 --> 00:02:11.490
Nice to meet you, Dorothy.

00:02:11.930 --> 00:02:13.560
Thank you.

00:02:15.040 --> 00:02:17.120
Tell me about your job.

00:02:18.040 --> 00:02:22.320
Einar, what do you think this place looks like?

00:02:23.100 --> 00:02:24.740
Well...

00:02:24.740 --> 00:02:26.740
Is this a forest?

00:02:27.940 --> 00:02:28.400
Yeah.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:42.120
No. This is the future wheat field. This forest is my property. I'll lend it to you two.

00:02:44.200 --> 00:02:44.600
Tomorrow?

00:02:45.250 --> 00:02:59.520
Yes. I'll leave it to you. Buy this land, operate it, and harvest it. I'll buy it at the right price. If that amount exceeds your price, I'll do it myself.

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:07.940
You mean, you can be free by yourself?

00:03:08.260 --> 00:03:10.780
Yes, that's right.

00:03:10.900 --> 00:03:13.140
Be free with your own strength and right hand.

00:03:14.360 --> 00:03:18.360
Depending on your efforts, it may happen within three years.

00:03:20.120 --> 00:03:23.040
I'll wait until the first harvest.

00:03:24.830 --> 00:03:27.170
What's wrong?

00:03:27.290 --> 00:03:28.190
Is it a bad luck?

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:34.230
N-No, thank you very much! I'll do my best!

00:03:34.470 --> 00:03:40.880
If you have any questions, please ask this Patel.

00:03:41.660 --> 00:03:44.400
I know him very well.

00:03:44.500 --> 00:03:46.050
Nice to meet you.

00:03:46.170 --> 00:03:49.210
I also became free in the same way.

00:03:49.430 --> 00:03:53.110
It must be hard to get used to the land, but do your best.

00:03:53.390 --> 00:03:54.520
Y-Yes!

00:03:56.460 --> 00:03:58.360
Well, for today, you can visit Torfin's work.

00:04:00.160 --> 00:04:00.880
You must be tired after a long journey.

00:04:03.980 --> 00:04:07.700
Torfinn, I'm going to make sure that Einar is fine.

00:04:08.040 --> 00:04:09.070
Got it?

00:04:09.230 --> 00:04:09.510
Yes.

00:04:18.600 --> 00:04:19.880
Hey, what's wrong with my husband?

00:04:20.480 --> 00:04:20.920
Huh?

00:04:21.080 --> 00:04:25.110
Hey, wait a minute!

00:04:25.350 --> 00:04:29.780
Hey, what kind of person is he?

00:04:32.300 --> 00:04:36.860
Is it normal in Denmark?

00:04:37.120 --> 00:04:42.370
There were slaves in my hometown, but they were always slaves.

00:04:42.870 --> 00:04:51.850
Oh, I was born in Northern England. What about you?

00:04:55.910 --> 00:04:56.330
Iceland.

00:04:58.560 --> 00:04:59.440
Yeah, Iceland.

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:02.820
Iceland? Where in Iceland?

00:05:07.720 --> 00:05:08.440
That's amazing.

00:05:09.070 --> 00:05:11.190
You've already cut quite a bit, haven't you?

00:05:11.390 --> 00:05:13.290
How much more do you need?

00:05:13.510 --> 00:05:17.340
All the way here.

00:05:17.940 --> 00:05:19.640
All the way here?

00:05:19.840 --> 00:05:24.400
There's a river there.

00:05:25.650 --> 00:05:26.270
All the way from that river.

00:05:27.270 --> 00:05:29.240
From the river?

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:32.020
This side...

00:05:35.530 --> 00:05:36.570
That means...

00:05:36.570 --> 00:05:41.540
There's still quite a bit left?

00:06:01.140 --> 00:06:01.980
What?

00:06:02.380 --> 00:06:06.300
I'm sorry.

00:06:10.260 --> 00:06:15.580
I told you to watch the show.

00:06:16.740 --> 00:06:20.300
I want to be free as soon as possible.

00:06:20.740 --> 00:06:21.830
I'm sorry.

00:06:24.600 --> 00:06:26.820
Then, please play a little bit of a distant tree.

00:06:28.190 --> 00:06:29.860
And the river and chocolate.

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:31.000
Cut it so that it can fall off at once.

00:06:31.460 --> 00:06:33.280
I see.

00:06:33.500 --> 00:06:35.550
You're going to pour it into the river and carry it.

00:06:35.950 --> 00:06:48.630
Hey, what's going on with lunch here?

00:06:49.370 --> 00:06:52.110
There is.

00:06:52.270 --> 00:06:55.550
That's good.

00:06:55.850 --> 00:06:57.340
Are you going to pick it up?

00:06:57.580 --> 00:06:57.980
Somewhere?

00:06:58.950 --> 00:06:59.350
No.

00:06:59.450 --> 00:06:59.970
That's it.

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:01.460
It's about time for the executioner to bring it.

00:07:01.740 --> 00:07:02.670
Is that so?

00:07:02.990 --> 00:07:04.540
You're such a pain in the ass.

00:07:06.420 --> 00:07:08.110
Are you serious?

00:07:08.870 --> 00:07:09.470
I'm serious.

00:07:09.930 --> 00:07:11.150
Hey, it's lunch time.

00:07:11.790 --> 00:07:12.890
Right, Torokin?

00:07:13.030 --> 00:07:17.610
I'm serious.

00:07:18.050 --> 00:07:19.890
You're the only one who hasn't done it.

00:07:20.210 --> 00:07:21.780
Ugh, I didn't know.

00:07:22.640 --> 00:07:24.060
Then, shall we go around tonight?

00:07:25.010 --> 00:07:26.310
Yeah, go, go.

00:07:26.510 --> 00:07:27.810
Go and get dumped.

00:07:28.190 --> 00:07:28.690
No way.

00:07:30.090 --> 00:07:32.750
Hey, isn't that Shin Iri?

00:07:33.250 --> 00:07:35.420
Yeah, looks like it.

00:07:35.780 --> 00:07:38.340
Heh, he's an idiot, a slave.

00:07:38.980 --> 00:07:41.340
H-hello, I'm...

00:07:41.340 --> 00:07:43.900
Ah, I know, I've heard of you.

00:07:44.630 --> 00:07:45.510
Um...

00:07:45.510 --> 00:07:45.930
Huh?

00:07:46.780 --> 00:07:49.240
Huh? What is this?

00:07:49.750 --> 00:07:50.760
It's your lunch.

00:07:51.820 --> 00:07:52.300
Huh?

00:07:56.080 --> 00:07:57.100
Well, it's fine.

00:07:58.040 --> 00:07:59.060
Um...

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:01.790
That's what I'm talking about.

00:08:01.790 --> 00:08:03.380
That's what I'm talking about.

00:08:03.460 --> 00:08:07.880
What? This much?

00:08:08.660 --> 00:08:09.140
What?

00:08:09.680 --> 00:08:10.750
Are you complaining?

00:08:11.590 --> 00:08:13.750
No, I'm not complaining.

00:08:14.290 --> 00:08:16.740
This is for the two of us.

00:08:18.590 --> 00:08:19.530
Yeah, yeah.

00:08:19.730 --> 00:08:20.910
That's what I'm talking about.

00:08:21.260 --> 00:08:22.380
Come on, come on.

00:08:23.260 --> 00:08:23.880
Hey, you.

00:08:24.260 --> 00:08:24.910
Is this your first time working as a slave?

00:08:26.430 --> 00:08:28.810
Yeah, well...

00:08:28.810 --> 00:08:29.090
Hey!

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:30.900
Then remember this.

00:08:31.160 --> 00:08:36.750
We, the free people, have delivered lunch to you guys who can't even eat.

00:08:37.170 --> 00:08:39.200
First of all, bow.

00:08:39.840 --> 00:08:47.390
Hey, say it.

00:08:48.060 --> 00:08:49.960
Thank you very much!

00:08:50.600 --> 00:08:56.100
What's with those eyes?

00:08:56.400 --> 00:08:57.760
You...

00:09:01.280 --> 00:09:04.360
Thank you very much.

00:09:04.480 --> 00:09:16.190
Dolphin, teach him a lesson.

00:09:16.650 --> 00:09:19.940
And horse, don't let him get hurt!

00:09:20.460 --> 00:09:20.900
Yes.

00:09:32.390 --> 00:09:33.510
He's taking a nap.

00:09:35.440 --> 00:09:36.420
What's with them?

00:09:36.660 --> 00:09:38.180
They came to skip school, didn't they?

00:09:38.420 --> 00:09:40.830
You, too.

00:09:41.590 --> 00:09:43.780
No matter how much of a slave you are, don't make a fuss.

00:09:44.440 --> 00:09:49.220
Einar, push from the back.

00:09:49.840 --> 00:09:51.140
I'll pull it in front.

00:09:51.480 --> 00:09:57.900
If you bring it to the river bank, I'll make it a boat.

00:09:58.220 --> 00:09:59.940
You...

00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:01.850
Why don't you come here a little bit longer?

00:10:03.300 --> 00:10:04.600
It's impossible to have a horse that's a year older than you.

00:10:05.400 --> 00:10:09.880
The tree belongs to my husband. I can't make it short on my own.

00:10:10.060 --> 00:10:14.690
Yeah, this is their job, isn't it?

00:10:14.770 --> 00:10:17.600
They don't usually let slaves handle horses, do they?

00:10:18.600 --> 00:10:20.020
And with such a shabby horse.

00:10:20.700 --> 00:10:22.260
It's okay. Let's go.

00:10:22.420 --> 00:10:22.740
Yeah.

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:33.920
E-Einaru!

00:10:33.920 --> 00:10:34.830
Y-Yeah?

00:10:35.110 --> 00:10:47.650
Einaru, lift up the front.

00:10:48.270 --> 00:10:49.340
O-Okay!

00:11:01.550 --> 00:11:02.430
Thank you.

00:11:30.280 --> 00:11:34.740
I can't forgive them. They ate my lunch.

00:11:35.300 --> 00:11:38.820
You know what they're like, right?

00:11:39.120 --> 00:11:41.980
They have no land, so they have no choice but to work for their boss.

00:11:43.480 --> 00:11:44.080
Yeah.

00:11:47.780 --> 00:11:48.020
What?

00:11:49.220 --> 00:11:52.090
You're half a slave, aren't you?

00:11:52.170 --> 00:11:55.410
You're bullying us to make sure we're inferior to you!

00:12:00.830 --> 00:12:03.220
Hey, Thorfinn! You think so too, don't you?

00:12:05.170 --> 00:12:08.560
Well, I don't care about that.

00:12:09.900 --> 00:12:14.050
What do you mean, you don't care?

00:12:14.250 --> 00:12:16.700
We're your property!

00:12:17.340 --> 00:12:19.680
There's no reason for a tyrant to use his pride!

00:12:20.660 --> 00:12:21.720
I'm telling you!

00:12:22.520 --> 00:12:27.140
Stop it. You're just making things worse.

00:12:31.180 --> 00:12:33.790
Is that all you've got?!

00:12:33.790 --> 00:12:40.580
Einar Torfin!

00:12:41.860 --> 00:12:42.740
Master...

00:12:42.740 --> 00:12:48.260
How was your day, Einar?

00:12:48.300 --> 00:12:51.030
Um, I have a report...

00:12:51.120 --> 00:12:51.740
Stop it.

00:12:51.820 --> 00:12:52.640
Shut up!

00:12:53.410 --> 00:12:55.040
Um, I have a report.

00:12:55.520 --> 00:12:57.830
Today, this report...

00:12:57.830 --> 00:12:58.520
...man?

00:13:17.790 --> 00:13:18.750
What's wrong, Einar?

00:13:18.850 --> 00:13:19.730
That bastard.

00:13:19.950 --> 00:13:24.320
He's a weirdo.

00:13:24.460 --> 00:13:26.500
If there's nothing else, I'm going.

00:13:53.450 --> 00:13:54.150
Are you sure you want to go to Japan?

00:14:00.760 --> 00:14:01.300
Shut up.

00:14:01.300 --> 00:14:25.210
Let's go.

00:14:25.460 --> 00:14:25.780
Hey!

00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:32.550
It's hot today, isn't it?

00:14:34.200 --> 00:14:36.040
From the lake!

00:14:36.300 --> 00:14:40.910
Give me a drink!

00:14:41.410 --> 00:14:43.010
Ah, the ambulance!

00:14:43.610 --> 00:14:49.430
I'm sorry.

00:14:49.830 --> 00:14:52.100
I went all the way to this lake.

00:14:53.210 --> 00:14:56.140
You seem to be back to life.

00:14:56.520 --> 00:14:57.570
Thank you.

00:14:57.830 --> 00:14:59.350
You're welcome.

00:15:00.410 --> 00:15:02.280
Alright, everyone!

00:15:03.280 --> 00:15:04.040
One more thing!

00:15:04.600 --> 00:15:06.400
Clean up this place by noon!

00:15:07.560 --> 00:15:08.340
Yes, sir!

00:15:08.620 --> 00:15:12.740
He's working himself.

00:15:12.940 --> 00:15:15.420
I thought a rich man wouldn't work.

00:15:16.500 --> 00:15:23.790
He looks the same as both Denji and Ringo.

00:15:31.820 --> 00:15:36.140
No, no, no! Don't make me say it again, Ormaru!

00:15:36.240 --> 00:15:39.210
What's wrong with you? You're doing as I told you to do!

00:15:39.390 --> 00:15:44.040
Use your hands! And you have to cut it at a height that's about as low as your knees!

00:15:44.640 --> 00:15:46.240
I've told you before!

00:15:46.560 --> 00:15:49.160
I just have to cut it, right?

00:15:49.800 --> 00:15:53.290
Hey, you idiot! The root of the wheat is the harvest!

00:15:53.610 --> 00:15:58.200
It's for the livestock to eat it later!

00:15:58.760 --> 00:15:59.980
Basically, you're...

00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:02.600
I'm 17 years old now, and I still don't know how to do my job.

00:16:03.220 --> 00:16:05.330
That's why I don't understand the meaning of each and every task.

00:16:08.370 --> 00:16:09.770
I don't understand.

00:16:10.320 --> 00:16:11.650
You're perfect.

00:16:12.370 --> 00:16:15.180
Don't you listen to me?

00:16:16.580 --> 00:16:19.290
That's why people who stand on people...

00:16:19.290 --> 00:16:20.350
Yes, yes, yes.

00:16:20.510 --> 00:16:21.090
It's under the knee.

00:16:21.950 --> 00:16:23.210
I got it.

00:16:24.650 --> 00:16:25.900
Idiot.

00:16:26.020 --> 00:16:27.280
What's with the way you shake?

00:16:27.890 --> 00:16:29.770
It's more broken than nothing, isn't it?

00:16:31.190 --> 00:16:32.270
What the hell is that?

00:16:32.390 --> 00:16:33.920
He's getting on my nerves.

00:16:34.220 --> 00:16:36.150
That's my husband's child, Ormal.

00:16:36.770 --> 00:16:38.520
Oh, a parent and child.

00:16:40.210 --> 00:16:41.680
I'm not doing it!

00:16:42.240 --> 00:16:43.940
If you help me calmly,

00:16:44.820 --> 00:16:45.840
I'll get into trouble!

00:16:47.060 --> 00:16:48.620
Oh, I quit.

00:16:48.880 --> 00:16:50.870
I thought I was going to do it, but I quit.

00:16:51.910 --> 00:16:54.260
Hey, where are you going, Ormal?

00:16:54.480 --> 00:16:56.260
Where the hell are you?

00:16:56.780 --> 00:16:57.280
You bastard!

00:16:57.680 --> 00:16:59.650
You're going to die in this farm!

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:02.460
Hurry up and be a little more self-aware!

00:17:02.600 --> 00:17:04.360
I'm asking you to tell me when you're going to do it!

00:17:05.700 --> 00:17:12.260
A big man is doing a lot of dirty work!

00:17:13.640 --> 00:17:15.730
I'm going to do it with this guy!

00:17:18.900 --> 00:17:26.620
What are you doing?

00:17:26.960 --> 00:17:27.480
What?

00:17:27.600 --> 00:17:28.420
What is it?

00:17:38.370 --> 00:17:42.930
I'm not waiting for you!

00:17:43.190 --> 00:17:49.400
I'm going to England.

00:17:50.000 --> 00:17:52.250
I'm going to Krasnoyarsk.

00:17:52.430 --> 00:17:58.350
I can't afford to spend my whole life in the countryside.

00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:03.550
I'll join your army and give you a lot of rewards.

00:18:04.170 --> 00:18:25.520
When is the nearest house?

00:18:26.300 --> 00:18:28.800
The nearest house is the nearest house.

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:31.820
In the meantime, King Harald should be collecting reinforcements.

00:18:32.940 --> 00:18:37.150
I think it's better for you to follow me.

00:18:37.990 --> 00:18:41.980
Huh? You too? What do you know?

00:18:42.480 --> 00:18:46.080
I'm not worried. I'm worried.

00:18:46.520 --> 00:18:47.200
Because...

00:19:02.720 --> 00:19:04.720
Alright, alright, young lady!

00:19:04.940 --> 00:19:06.080
This is how it's done!

00:19:06.460 --> 00:19:07.040
How's it going?

00:19:07.520 --> 00:19:07.920
Good!

00:19:08.260 --> 00:19:09.520
I brought you some food!

00:19:09.920 --> 00:19:10.420
Shh!

00:19:10.760 --> 00:19:13.490
Stop it!

00:19:13.730 --> 00:19:14.780
You're going to get in trouble!

00:19:15.660 --> 00:19:16.640
Oh my!

00:19:16.960 --> 00:19:17.180
Shh!

00:19:20.450 --> 00:19:25.260
This is a relief for our house.

00:19:25.840 --> 00:19:27.340
You're right.

00:19:27.660 --> 00:19:29.040
If you keep going around like this,

00:19:29.040 --> 00:19:29.640
I'm sorry, I can't help it.

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:37.660
If you let me go, I'll be in trouble.

00:19:38.980 --> 00:19:45.070
My daughter is going to be in trouble.

00:19:45.250 --> 00:19:50.530
I know what you guys are up to.

00:19:50.910 --> 00:19:54.980
Even if you're poor, your father's wealth is your priority.

00:19:55.520 --> 00:19:57.050
You can be rich if you become a relative of the Ketil family.

00:19:57.050 --> 00:19:58.750
If you become a relative and a relative, you can do a lot of things!

00:20:00.000 --> 00:20:01.740
I-I don't want to see anyone like that!

00:20:03.230 --> 00:20:10.190
That's not what we're trying to do!

00:20:10.450 --> 00:20:10.690
Master!

00:20:11.860 --> 00:20:12.000
Hey!

00:20:14.920 --> 00:20:16.290
This guy and that guy!

00:20:16.390 --> 00:20:17.620
I'm me!

00:20:17.960 --> 00:20:19.400
I'm not your father's sidekick!

00:20:19.900 --> 00:20:20.560
What?!

00:20:20.560 --> 00:20:21.990
This is not good!

00:20:23.680 --> 00:20:26.210
Oh, it's you, young master.

00:20:26.470 --> 00:20:28.220
Y-young master?

00:20:30.220 --> 00:20:30.400
Sir!

00:20:35.740 --> 00:20:36.100
What?

00:20:36.400 --> 00:20:36.580
Sir!

00:20:38.120 --> 00:20:39.400
It's dangerous at night!

00:20:40.100 --> 00:20:41.100
Dangerous!

00:20:42.520 --> 00:20:43.580
What are you guys doing?

00:20:44.320 --> 00:20:48.400
I'm going over there right now.

00:20:48.620 --> 00:20:51.460
Come on, walk properly.

00:20:52.260 --> 00:20:58.610
If you go to that woman's place, you'll be overtaken by the guards.

00:21:00.640 --> 00:21:00.900
Mugi?

00:21:01.160 --> 00:21:06.850
But if I argue with them, my brother will get angry again.

00:21:07.690 --> 00:21:09.210
I can't do it.

00:21:09.890 --> 00:21:12.270
I can't do it.

00:21:12.870 --> 00:21:14.140
I'm young.

00:21:14.760 --> 00:21:16.140
I'm free in this farm.

00:21:18.940 --> 00:21:20.790
Shut up.

00:21:20.970 --> 00:21:22.400
Do you understand how I feel?

00:21:23.680 --> 00:21:25.680
Are you angry? Are you angry?

00:21:26.000 --> 00:21:27.040
Are you worried about something?

00:21:27.300 --> 00:21:28.820
I'm not angry.

00:21:30.000 --> 00:21:33.400
You know, I'm too busy to take care of you guys.

00:21:34.120 --> 00:21:36.300
Go back to the fortress and sleep!

00:21:37.020 --> 00:21:39.360
Well, well, well, well, well, well, well, well, well, well.

00:21:39.510 --> 00:21:40.750
That's not how you do it!

00:21:41.170 --> 00:21:42.110
You're still young.

00:21:42.450 --> 00:21:43.030
You're cold.

00:21:43.790 --> 00:21:44.230
Hey!

00:21:44.830 --> 00:21:45.770
Don't take my horse's mouth!

00:21:46.450 --> 00:21:47.790
It's okay, it's okay.

00:21:47.990 --> 00:21:48.630
Let's drink again!

00:21:48.910 --> 00:21:49.870
Okay? Let's drink again!

00:21:50.590 --> 00:21:52.750
We can chat tonight, young man.

00:21:53.290 --> 00:21:53.890
We don't need to worry about the session.

00:21:55.890 --> 00:21:58.920
